# caught-looking

- **Stack**: Go 1.22 API (`backend/`, chi), React 19 + Vite + TypeScript (`frontend/`).
- **Local dev**: from repo root, `make dev` runs the API (:8080) and Vite; the frontend proxies `/api` to the backend (see `Makefile`).
- **Conventions**: follow the scoped rules when editing `frontend/**/*.tsx`, `frontend/src/api/**/*.ts`, `frontend/src/types/api.d.ts`, `frontend/**/*.{test,spec}.{ts,tsx}`, or `backend/**/*.go`. Frontend tests: **`.cursor/skills/frontend-vitest-tests/SKILL.md`**.
- **Before opening a PR**: CI must pass (`frontend`: lint, typecheck, test, build; `backend`: vet, test, build). Fill out `.github/pull_request_template.md`.
